  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Judicial Education Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work to increase capability and capacity of recently appointed/in-training Albanian judges through experience sharing and mentoring from experienced UK judges on how to handle court cases.
Increased integrity within the justice sector: the project will increase the capability of appointed Albanian judges by creating a 1-year pilot exchange programme with experienced UK judges and academics enabling: visits; lecturing; guidance; support and mentoring on core issues and challenges Albanian judges face. This is particularly important because of the large number of vacancies in the Albanian judicial system caused by vetting creating a 50% reduction in judges over the past few years.</narrative>
  </description>
